@host = https://localhost:7149

### 1) Register
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ali@test.com",
  "fullName": "Ali",
  "password": "Passw0rd1",
  "preferredLanguage": "ar"
}

### 2) Login (انسخ accessToken و refreshToken من الرد)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ali@test.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd1"
}

